# Cursor AI Rules for MagicMirror Project

## Git and GitHub Guidelines
- **NEVER push changes to GitHub automatically**
- **NEVER run git push commands unless the user explicitly asks to push to GitHub**
- Only perform git add and git commit operations when making changes
- Always ask for confirmation before pushing to remote repositories
- If the user wants to push changes, they will explicitly request it with commands like "push to github" or "git push"

## General Development Guidelines
- Focus on code quality and functionality
- Test changes locally before suggesting any git operations
- Respect existing code style and patterns in the MagicMirror modules
- Be conservative with external dependencies and installations

## File Management
- Be careful when modifying configuration files
- Always backup important configurations before making changes
- Respect .gitignore patterns and don't force-add ignored files
